[15:25:30Z] POWER:    reboot (warm reboot), shutdown|off (power off, cold-boot-ready) - via the platform firmware
[15:25:30Z] NETWORK:  ifconfig  (NIC: MAC, link, counters), ping <ip> [count], arp <ip>
